bmp.h1_f:
mailbox_id = HKDF(recipient_pubkey, info="bmp-v1", len=32)
Dipòsit: POST /bmp/deposit {mailbox_id, blob ≤1MB}
Recollida: GET /bmp/messages (autoritzat)

